Column name: month_of_crash Type: NUMBER Description: This data element records the month in which the crash occurred. 01 January 02 February 03 March 04 April 05 May 06 June 07 July 08 August 09 September 10 October 11 November 12 December -- Unknown
Column name: person_number Type: NUMBER Description: This data element is the consecutive number assigned to each person in the case (i.e., each occupant, pedestrian, or non-motorists involved in the crash). This data element appears on each person level data file and is used in conjunction with the ST_CASE data element (and sometimes the VEH_NO data element) to merge information from person level data files. 001-999 Assigned Person Number
